#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:5 67d770bf15d24eefbc15dfd04bb9d2ab
msgid "AUTOLAND Mode"
msgstr "AUTOLAND 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:7 9343db0c477846a5b6c5dcb37b8807e6
msgid ""
"AUTOLAND mode provides a fully automatic fixed wing landing which can also "
"be used as an RC failsafe action."
msgstr "AUTOLAND 模式提供完全自动的固定翼降落，也可用作遥控失控保护动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:9 8a8dda89832b43c19eb1842f2e8b43b3
msgid ""
"In TAKEOFF, FBWA, MANUAL, TRAINING, ACRO,  STABILIZE modes, and during a "
"NAV_TAKEOFF in AUTO, the takeoff direction will be captured from the GPS "
"ground course once a GPS ground speed of 5m/s is obtained. This usually "
"occurs early in the takeoff run of a rolling takeoff or almost immediately "
"during a hand or bungee launch."
msgstr ""
"在 TAKEOFF、FBWA、MANUAL、TRAINING、ACRO、STABILIZE 模式以及 AUTO 中的 NAV_TAKEOFF 期间，一旦"
" GPS 地速达到 5m/s，将从 GPS 地面航向捕获起飞方向。这通常在滚动起飞的起飞滑跑早期或手抛/弹射起飞后几乎立即发生。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:11 427327266eb74e62bc2c70e67f6447a7
msgid ""
"It will setup a parameterized LOITER-TO-ALT base waypoint and final approach"
" waypoint/altitude, based on the takeoff direction, and proceed to it, "
"loiter down in altitude if required, and then switch to an automatic landing"
" at home. It can also be selected as a :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` for"
" RC failsafes."
msgstr ""
"它将根据起飞方向建立参数化的盘旋降高基础航点和最终进近航点/高度，飞往该点，在需要时盘旋降低高度，然后切换到 Home "
"自动降落。也可以选择为遥控失控保护设置 :ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:13 d8d0c82c73a64cd8b5575a6c762687b9
msgid ""
"This is useful when programming a mission with a ``DO_LAND_START`` landing "
"sequence is not convenient since it requires a GCS on a laptop or phone, "
"such as traveling with impromptu stops to fly FPV or photograph. Simply "
"takeoff in one of the previously mentioned modes and the AUTOLAND will be "
"setup. It is also useful for fields which have varying wind directions, "
"which would prevent using a single home-loaded autolanding mission or "
"require using the MissionSelector LUA script to select from several missions"
" with different approaches."
msgstr ""
"当使用 ``DO_LAND_START`` 降落序列编程任务不方便时（因为需要使用笔记本电脑或手机上的 GCS，例如临时停下来飞行 FPV "
"或拍摄），此功能非常有用。只需在前述任一模式中起飞，AUTOLAND 即会设置好。对于风向多变的场地，它也很有用，因为这样无法使用单一的 Home "
"加载自动降落任务，或者需要使用 MissionSelector LUA 脚本从多个不同进近方向的任务中选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:15 a9503077209643278bd88b4824b27efb
msgid ""
"Upon entry, an optional minimum climb to an above ground alt before turning "
"can be programmed, which can be useful if it is used for RC failsafe when "
"this occurs during takeoff to climb to an altitude to clear obstacles or to "
"get a minimum altitude above current terrain before turning toward the "
"landing approach."
msgstr ""
"进入时，可以编程一个可选的最小爬升至地面以上某高度后再转弯，这在作为遥控失控保护时于起飞期间触发的情况下非常有用，可以爬升到足以清除侧方障碍物的高度，或者在转向降落进近前获得最低地形以上高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:17 25d34a95f7fa4b5893973053de84849a
msgid ""
"If :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` is set to 1 or \"AUTOLAND\", then "
"the vehicle will terrain follow as it flies to the LOITER-TO-ALT base "
"waypoint."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` 设为 1 "
"或「AUTOLAND」，飞行器在飞往盘旋降高基础航点时将跟随地形。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:19 e8c400463c414bd985963262230a069e
msgid ""
"AUTOLAND mode may be entered either as a :ref:`normal flight mode switch "
"<flight-modes>` or as an :ref:`RC Auxiliary switch <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` set to \"183\"."
msgstr ""
"AUTOLAND 模式可以作为 :ref:`普通飞行模式开关 <flight-modes>` 进入，或作为设为「183」的 :ref:`RC 辅助开关 "
"<common-auxiliary-functions>` 进入。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:22 106ef02965bc419aaae89f65672066dc
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:23 379020f1d8f44fe7be4579069ff0f4fb
msgid ""
"To use simply make a takeoff and at any point later switch into AUTOLAND. A "
"final approach waypoint will be created behind the HOME landing target at "
":ref:`AUTOLAND_WP_DIST<AUTOLAND_WP_DIST>` (400m by default) at "
":ref:`AUTOLAND_WP_ALT<AUTOLAND_WP_ALT>`  (55m by default)using the takeoff "
"direction plus :ref:`AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF<AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF>` (\"0\" default) and"
" land using all the parametrics of a normal autolanding. A loiter to alt "
"waypoint tangential to the final approach waypoint is also created at the "
"same altitude and at 1/3 :ref:`AUTOLAND_WP_DIST<AUTOLAND_WP_DIST>` or "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>`, whichever is smaller, from the final "
"approach waypoint as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"使用时，只需进行起飞，在之后的任意时刻切换到 AUTOLAND。将根据起飞方向加 "
":ref:`AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF<AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF>` （默认为「0」），在 Home 降落目标后方 "
":ref:`AUTOLAND_WP_DIST<AUTOLAND_WP_DIST>` （默认 400m）处、高度 "
":ref:`AUTOLAND_WP_ALT<AUTOLAND_WP_ALT>` （默认 "
"55m）处创建最终进近航点，并使用普通自动降落的所有参数进行降落。还将在最终进近航点切点处创建盘旋降高航点，高度相同，距最终进近航点为 1/3 "
":ref:`AUTOLAND_WP_DIST<AUTOLAND_WP_DIST>` 或 "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` 中较小者，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:28 7cb4c5a3d1324e2a9685775bdca669a2
msgid ""
"``LAND`` parameter defaults are usually acceptable for most planes in the "
"1-2m wingspan, <2kg class) and should yeild a safe, if not optimally tuned, "
"autolanding. ``LAND`` parameters can be optimized with test flights (See "
":ref:`automatic-landing`)."
msgstr ""
"``LAND`` 参数默认值通常适用于大多数翼展 1-2m、重量小于 2kg 的飞机，应能产生安全的（即使不是最优调参的）自动降落。``LAND`` "
"参数可以通过试飞进行优化（参见 :ref:`automatic-landing`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:31 d53c997978aa434cb9b2d34500b72838
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:33 2732575bf8ec479d9d5d37d81d3250d1
msgid ""
"The :ref:`AUTOLAND_OPTIONS <AUTOLAND_OPTIONS>` bitmask provides optional "
"behavior. Currently, if bit 0 is set, then instead of capturing takeoff "
"direction( and therefore autolanding direction), the landing direction will "
"be captured immediately at arming if a compass is being used. This allows "
"the direction to be set \"manually\" by orienting the plane at homw in the "
"desired landing direction and arming. The  "
":ref:`AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF<AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF>` parameter is ignored in this case."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AUTOLAND_OPTIONS <AUTOLAND_OPTIONS>` 位掩码提供可选行为。目前，如果位 0 "
"被设置，则不是捕获起飞方向（因而也是自动降落方向），而是在使用罗盘时，在解锁时立即捕获降落方向。这允许通过在 Home "
"处将飞机朝向所需降落方向并解锁来「手动」设置方向。在这种情况下，:ref:`AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF<AUTOLAND_DIR_OFF>` "
"参数被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:36 c4ced355a69b4ad1a62d8b6013c20505
msgid ""
"A minimum climb  of :ref:`AUTOLAND_CLIMB<AUTOLAND_CLIMB>` can be set, during"
" which navigation (roll) is limited to "
":ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>`. If AUTOLAND is being used as a "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`, then setting this to allow clearing "
"takeoff obstacles to the sides is recommended. The climb altitude will be "
"above terrain, if enabled, or using rangefinder, if enabled and in range, or"
" just relative to current altitude if neither is available."
msgstr ""
"可设置最小爬升高度 :ref:`AUTOLAND_CLIMB<AUTOLAND_CLIMB>`，在此期间导航（横滚）限制为 "
":ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT<LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>`。如果 AUTOLAND 用作 "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>` "
"且在起飞期间触发，建议设置此值以允许清除侧方起飞障碍物。如果启用了地形跟随，爬升高度将高于地形；如果启用了测距仪且在量程内，则使用测距仪；否则仅相对于当前高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:39 26ff2caf98674793a8130e2951f92607
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "注意："

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:41 b4e72134d69b42729a89ad2da2b1de56
msgid ""
"Switching out of AUTOLAND to another mode aborts the landing and returns "
"control to that new mode."
msgstr "切换出 AUTOLAND 到另一模式将中止降落并将控制权返回给新模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:42 6d90177849834b519e697da40d07133d
msgid ""
"Throttle aborts of the final landing sequence are not supported. "
"(:ref:`LAND_ABORT_THR<LAND_ABORT_THR>`)"
msgstr "不支持最终降落序列的油门中止。（:ref:`LAND_ABORT_THR<LAND_ABORT_THR>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:43 b0dd82eeef5a4015a15c8b099577d9c0
msgid ""
"If the plane has taken off not using the aforementioned modes, the mode "
"cannot be entered since the takeoff direction has not been captured. In "
"these cases, if it is selected as a long failsafe action (\"5\"), "
":ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`, it will switch to normal RTL instead of "
"AUTOLAND on failsafe."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机不是使用上述模式起飞的，则无法进入此模式，因为未捕获起飞方向。在这种情况下，如果它被选为长失控保护动作（「5」），:ref:`FS_LONG_ACTN<FS_LONG_ACTN>`，它将在失控保护时切换到普通"
" RTL 而非 AUTOLAND。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:44 d5be8292cbd84912891cadd2d3b73b35
msgid ""
"The mode co-exists with any mission autolanding sequence, which can be used "
"in AUTO mode, or with :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>`."
msgstr ""
"此模式与任何任务自动降落序列共存，后者可在 AUTO 模式中使用，或与 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 一起使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/mode_autoland.rst:45 55448ead903b45c9af9ccd8280bc647c
msgid "QuadPlanes cannot use this mode."
msgstr "QuadPlane 无法使用此模式。"
